<title>THAILAND: Siam Cement Q3 net rises 13.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Siam Cement Q3 net rises 13.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consolidated financial results for three and nine months ended September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>					 Third quarter</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		12.53     vs	   11.01</p>
<p>    Net		    1,503.64     vs	1,321.72</p>
<p>					  Nine months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		48.67     vs	   43.29</p>
<p>    Net		    5,839.84     vs	5,194.73</p>
<p>NOTES:  Revs not stated. Company's full name is Siam Cement Plc.</p>
<p>The construction materials group said its unconsolidated net profit rose to 930.82 million baht, or 7.76 baht a share, in the third quarter from 624.58 million or 5.20 baht a year-ago period.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662)-2529950-3</p>
